        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-HPULL36-613, 20 Inch c.c. Oil Rubbed Bronze Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade out of stainless steel with an oil rubbed bronze powder-coat finish, this 3 foot ladder pull is great for use on almost any door. It can be mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors ranging from 1/4 inches thick to 2-1/2 inches thick. Choose from thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted (just make sure to order 2 pulls if you choose this option). The 36 Inch Oil Rubbed Bronze Ladder Door Pull has 20 Inch center to centers and has a 1-1/4 inch diameter for the perfect grip. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-HPULL36-Specifications.gif?v=1704354501\" width=\"493\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-HPULL36-613 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other lengths: <a href=\"/products/2-foot-oil-rubbed-bronze-ladder-pull-dwd-hpull24-613\"><b>24\" Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/48-inch-oil-rubbed-bronze-ladder-pull-dwd-hpull48-613\"><b>48\" Door Pull</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/60-inch-oil-rubbed-bronze-ladder-pull-dwd-hpull60-613\"><b>60\" Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD HPULL36-613 Oil Rubbed Bronze Stainless Steel Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li> \r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 36\" (914 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 20\" (508 mm) </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\" (80 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" (32 mm) Round</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant Door Hardware</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "36 Inch Oil Rubbed Bronze Ladder Door Pull, DWD-HPULL36-613",
                "description": "DWD-HPULL36-613, 36 Inch Oil Rubbed Bronze Ladder Door Pull - Made out of stainless steel with an oil rubbed bronze powder-coat finish, this 3 foot ladder pull is great for use on almost any door. It can be mounted on wood, glass, or metal doors ranging from 1/4 inches thick to 2-1/2 inches thick. Choose from thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted (just make sure to order 2 pulls if you choose this option). The 36 Inch Oil Rubbed Bronze Ladder Door Pull has 20 Inch center to centers and has a 1-1/4 inch diameter for the perfect grip. \r\n",
